{"articleNo":"69339","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=69339&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"지식재산능력시험응시접수안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.06","hit":"4896","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">[지식재산능력시험 접수방법 안내]</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">우리 학교는 단체로 접수가 가능토록 합의가 되었습니다.&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">아래&nbsp;내용을 참고하여 접수하여 주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">ㅇ 접수방법</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - IPAT 홈페이지(</span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.ipat.or.kr/\">www.ipat.or.kr</a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">) 접속후 회원가입(로그인)</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">- 단체명 : 금오공과대학교지식재산팀</font></strong></span></p><p><strong><font color=\"#cc3d3d\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 인증기 : kumoh12</span></span></span></font></strong></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 라고 입력하면 접수대기상태라고 나타나고,&nbsp;결제금액은 0원으로 표시되면 </span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 접수완료상태입니다. </span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - 접수증은 11월 20일부터 IPAT홈페이지에서&nbsp;출력할 수 있습니다. </span></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">ㅇ&nbsp;이미 개인별로 접수한 학생도 단체로 가입되도록 변경조치토록 하며&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">ㅇ 시험응시료는 단체로 학교에서 할인가로 일괄&nbsp;납부할 예정입니다.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">ㅇ <font color=\"#0055ff\">11월 16일(금)개강하는 지식재산능력시험 대비강좌 </font>수강은&nbsp;의무사항은 아닙니다만&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 기출문제풀이와&nbsp;요약정리을 내용으로 강좌가&nbsp;진행되므로 많은 도움이 됩니다.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">ㅇ 문의 한국발명진흥회 02-3459-2818 </span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 산학협력단 (교내 7263)&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp; </span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
